OL,3,GNEWSAWinter garden to replace ice rink
OL,4,Aover Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FA winter garden is to replace
OL,7,FLeicester's festive ice rink over
OL,8,FChristmas, the city council has said.
OL,10,FLeicester City Council had organised an
OL,11,Fice rink in Jubilee Square since 2017
OL,12,Fbut said the attraction will not take
OL,13,Fplace this year after the operator
OL,14,Fpulled out because of a dispute with
OL,15,Fthe authority.
OL,17,FInstead, officials said the square
OL,18,Fwould be covered with festive lights,
OL,19,FChristmas trees, and illuminated igloos
OL,20,Fas well as a Ferris wheel.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
