OL,3,GNEWSAWinter garden to replace ice rink
OL,4,Aover Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plan for the new attraction was
OL,7,Fannounced on Thursday along with a
OL,8,Frange of other events, including the
OL,9,Fswitch-on of the city's Christmas
OL,10,Flights on Wednesday 18 November.
